{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can purchase the official release version of the game. By purchasing, they can play multiple levels and fight against various enemies. Players will also see several CG cutscenes, such as confrontations between the protagonist and bosses. They can enjoy beautiful scenery like starry skies, falling snow, and Tyndall rays shining through mountain landscapes. The total playtime is approximately 1\u20133 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player action-adventure RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Players must rely on their skills to defeat minor enemies and bosses, while also appreciating scenic views not visible during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Players use keyboard keys to move, attack, dodge, block, and more to overcome enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Developer:</strong> The developer is a PhD student at the Intelligent Instrumentation and Equipment Laboratory, College of Engineering, China Agricultural University in Haidian District, Beijing. Passionate about games since childhood, he is developing this project alone, handling programming, art, music, story, and design. Although one person\u2019s energy is limited and he often feels overwhelmed, he continues to listen to player feedback and improve the game. He welcomes communication and thanks all players for their support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461620?t=1770044077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461620/901c28ad391bc58cfa3edb53928cd28990137fc5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770044077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461620/514d23f9910077f29afb8dd38725d679841dcc3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770044077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461620/514d23f9910077f29afb8dd38725d679841dcc3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770044077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can purchase the official release version of the game. By purchasing, they can play multiple levels and fight against various enemies. Players will also see several CG cutscenes, such as confrontations between the protagonist and bosses. They can enjoy beautiful scenery like starry skies, falling snow, and Tyndall rays shining through mountain landscapes. The total playtime is approximately 1\u20133 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player action-adventure RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Players must rely on their skills to defeat minor enemies and bosses, while also appreciating scenic views not visible during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Players use keyboard keys to move, attack, dodge, block, and more to overcome enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Developer:</strong> The developer is a PhD student at the Intelligent Instrumentation and Equipment Laboratory, College of Engineering, China Agricultural University in Haidian District, Beijing. Passionate about games since childhood, he is developing this project alone, handling programming, art, music, story, and design. Although one person\u2019s energy is limited and he often feels overwhelmed, he continues to listen to player feedback and improve the game. He welcomes communication and thanks all players for their support!</p>","developers":["\u4e01\u5c0f\u5e06\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620f\u5f00\u53d1"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://sha